5,1,1,talk,Minato,,Hello everyone. I want to know about the people doing the work. I will look into in-house developer availability and staffing of the coordination group.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree we should be careful about dependencies. I'll check network coverage at customer plants and in-house developer availability.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,"I am concerned about the financial side of things. I will look into the capital budget and software allowance, and vendor licence pricing versus fixed-fee work.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
